{
 "voice": {
  "file": "voice_pack.ogg",
  "duration": 159.063,
  "lines": [
   {
    "id": "hub_welcome",
    "zone": "hub",
    "start": 0.3,
    "end": 2.94,
    "text": "Just a friendly reminder that you are amazing."
   },
   {
    "id": "time_1",
    "zone": "time",
    "start": 3.54,
    "end": 7.42,
    "text": "Time is already eating us. Each second is a small bite."
   },
   {
    "id": "time_2",
    "zone": "time",
    "start": 8.02,
    "end": 12.58,
    "text": "You are not watching time go by. Time is watching you disappear while it eats you."
   },
   {
    "id": "time_3",
    "zone": "time",
    "start": 13.18,
    "end": 17.76,
    "text": "Even while you are watching this, it is already taking the next second."
   },
   {
    "id": "hole_1",
    "zone": "hole",
    "start": 18.36,
    "end": 24.1,
    "text": "Putting yourself down is like jumping into a hole and asking yourself, why can't I see the sky?"
   },
   {
    "id": "hole_2",
    "zone": "hole",
    "start": 24.7,
    "end": 29.66,
    "text": "Every time you say \"I can't do it, I'm not good,\" it's another hand of dirt."
   },
   {
    "id": "hole_3",
    "zone": "hole",
    "start": 30.26,
    "end": 35.44,
    "text": "The funny thing is, the ground never pulled you down. Your thoughts kept digging."
   },
   {
    "id": "hole_4",
    "zone": "hole",
    "start": 36.04,
    "end": 44.84,
    "text": "The sky never disappeared. The sky never went away. You just stopped looking up. The light never left."
   },
   {
    "id": "hole_step",
    "zone": "hole",
    "start": 45.44,
    "end": 49.24,
    "text": "One better thought is one step higher."
   },
   {
    "id": "hole_move",
    "zone": "hole",
    "start": 49.84,
    "end": 53.94,
    "text": "You were never made to look at dirt. You were made to move."
   },
   {
    "id": "glass_1",
    "zone": "glass",
    "start": 54.54,
    "end": 62.66,
    "text": "It can also feel like you are in a glass box, and every word goes in like water slowly rising."
   },
   {
    "id": "glass_2",
    "zone": "glass",
    "start": 63.26,
    "end": 67.721,
    "text": "But the box is made in your mind, and the water is what you keep holding onto."
   },
   {
    "id": "glass_3",
    "zone": "glass",
    "start": 68.321,
    "end": 71.821,
    "text": "What they say is what they say. It is not who you are."
   },
   {
    "id": "glass_4",
    "zone": "glass",
    "start": 72.421,
    "end": 77.901,
    "text": "Not everything that tries reaching for you needs to stay in you."
   },
   {
    "id": "road_1",
    "zone": "road",
    "start": 78.501,
    "end": 87.001,
    "text": "Your feet being tired does not mean the road is over. It means you walked far."
   },
   {
    "id": "road_2",
    "zone": "road",
    "start": 87.601,
    "end": 95.462,
    "text": "Your mind feels heavy does not mean you are broken. It means that you are carried a lot."
   },
   {
    "id": "road_3",
    "zone": "road",
    "start": 96.062,
    "end": 104.422,
    "text": "The truth is, you didn't hit a wall. You just met something small and gave it a big name."
   },
   {
    "id": "chains_1",
    "zone": "chains",
    "start": 105.022,
    "end": 115.002,
    "text": "If you never walk, you will stay in the same place. If you never run, you will never see how far you could have gone."
   },
   {
    "id": "chains_2",
    "zone": "chains",
    "start": 115.602,
    "end": 120.903,
    "text": "Never let your mind lock you in a place your body could have left."
   },
   {
    "id": "chains_3",
    "zone": "chains",
    "start": 121.503,
    "end": 128.823,
    "text": "So move right now. Don't stay the same, or \"I can't\" will become your name."
   },
   {
    "id": "chains_4",
    "zone": "chains",
    "start": 129.423,
    "end": 134.423,
    "text": "If you stop, it all stops. If you keep going, you keep on growing."
   },
   {
    "id": "everything_1",
    "zone": "everything",
    "start": 135.023,
    "end": 142.943,
    "text": "One day you will look back and realize you were walking the whole time. You just didn't see it yet."
   },
   {
    "id": "everything_2",
    "zone": "everything",
    "start": 143.543,
    "end": 150.023,
    "text": "Keep on going, even when it feels like nothing, because one day that nothing becomes everything."
   },
   {
    "id": "everything_3",
    "zone": "everything",
    "start": 150.623,
    "end": 158.463,
    "text": "You don't have to be great today. You don't have to be the best. You just have to not stop."
   }
  ]
 },
